\par\par \b \uc2 Indian Rupee, Indonesian Rupiah Gain on  \highlight22\uc2 Central-Bank \highlight\uc2  Moves\b0\par\par\uc2 By Erin McCarthy   \par \uc2 562 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 August 2013\par 16:42\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 The Indian rupee lead gains among emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday on the back of new \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  measures aimed at supporting the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Reserve Bank of India\uc2  late Wednesday said it would sell dollars to the country's three state-run oil refiners through a designated commercial bank, shifting the bulk of the refiners' demand for dollars away from the open market. Oil refiners are India's biggest buyers of dollars, which they use to pay for crude-oil import.\par \par \uc2 As a result, the rupee soared 2.7% against the dollar, which bought INR66.98 in offshore trading, according to CQG.\par \par \uc2 "This has provided some relief, as this is taking care of a big chunk of the local corporate demand for dollars," \uc2 Societe Generale\uc2  analysts said in a note.\par \par \uc2 But they warned it may not be enough to sustain prolonged gains in the rupee. "While this measure may help alleviate tensions in the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, this is not a game changer, however," they added.\par \par \uc2 The Indonesian rupiah also gained modestly after the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised interest rates at an extra policy meeting Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The rupee and rupiah have been among the hardest-hit \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  this month. India and Indonesia's reliance on foreign money to fund their wide trade deficits has made investors particularly nervous about these \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , since a drawdown in U.S. Federal Reserve stimulus could result in less capital flows into these countries. The Fed is poised to start dialing down its bond-buying stimulus program as soon as September, analysts say.\par \par \uc2 Bank Indonesia\uc2  raised its main policy rate by a half-percentage point to 7% Thursday, reflecting a growing realization that defending the country's plunging \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  amid the emerging-market selloff is a more pressing need than maintaining rapid economic growth. The rupiah advanced a modest 0.2% to trade at IDR10,925 per dollar, after hitting four-year lows the previous session.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's interest-rate increase, however, didn't have the same desired impact on its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The real slipped 0.6% against the dollar, which bought BRL2.3585, according to CQG. Late Wednesday, \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its benchmark Selic rate by 50 basis points to 9%, as was widely expected by analysts. But analysts say the rate hike may not be enough to stem inflationary pressures\par \par \uc2 "With the considerable amount of [real] depreciation over the past three months and a high likelihood of a gasoline price hike towards year-end/early next year, inflationary pressure down the road should remain high," Nomura analysts said in a note.\par \par \uc2 In Europe, the lira was among the few gainers, despite data showing a wider-than-expected trade gap. Turkey's trade deficit widened to $9.8 billion from $8 billion in July, the Ankara-based state statistics agency TUIK said, compared with the market consensus of $8.4 billion. \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  consistently to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has fallen on concerns about its current account gap. It sold $50 million in a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  auction Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The lira strengthened 0.3% against the dollar, which bought TRY2.0318.\par \par \uc2 --Farida Husna and Gurdev Singh Virk contributed to this article.\par \par \uc2 Write to Erin McCarthy at erin.mccarthy@wsj.com [ 29-08-13 1442GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130829e98t000le\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
