\par\par \b \uc2 South African Rand, Emerging-Market  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Edge Lower After FOMC Minutes\b0\par\par\uc2 By Lauren Davidson   \par \uc2 262 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 August 2013\par 20:04\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 Emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  extended losses against the dollar Wednesday after the recently released Federal Reserve's July monetary policy meeting minutes did nothing to dispel expectations that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could begin winding down its stimulus efforts as soon as next month.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar gained 1.2% versus the South African rand to ZAR10.2776 late in the New York trading day. The greenback also climbed against Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , strengthening 1.8% against the Brazilian real to BRL 1.436 and 1.6% against the Mexican peso to MXN13.1739.\par \par \uc2 The Fed's $85 billion-a-month bond buying program has added liquidity to the market and driven investors toward high-yielding emerging-market assets. But as the U.S. its economy shows signs of recovery--and given the prospect of higher interest rates as the Fed ends its bond buying--investors are putting their money back into U.S. assets amid concerns over how developing countries' economies will fare once this global liquidity is drained.\par \par \uc2 Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were hit particularly hard, with the Indian rupee falling to fresh record-lows against the dollar, which gained 2.3% to INR64.59. The Indonesian rupiah slid to IDR10945 per dollar, down from IDR10729.0 late Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 Despite \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  attempts by \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem the lira's decline, the Turkish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell 1.4% against the dollar at TRL1.9764.\par \par \uc2 Write to Lauren Davidson at lauren.davidson@dowjones.com [ 21-08-13 1845GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130821e98l000kw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
