\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ Turkey's Real Effective Exchange Rate Rises To 119.95 in March Vs 119.69 in Feb\b0\par\par\uc2 294 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 April 2013\par 13:34\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 4 Apr 2013 08:20 EDT DJ  \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Real Effective Exchange Rate Nears Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Level\par \par \uc2 By Joe Parkinson\par \par \uc2 ISTANBUL--\b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real effective exchange rate rose in March, edging closer to the level at which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said it would take action to prevent further appreciation of the Turkish lira.\par \par \uc2 The measure of the lira's strength against several other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose to 119.95 in March from 119.69 in February, though was lower than a revised 120.39 in January, the Ankara-based \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in a report on its website Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The news come after \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Erdem Basci Wednesday said the national lender would consider easing monetary policy if the lira's real effective exchange rate rises above the threshold level of 120. Although Mr. Basci's comments weren't new, his comments were seen as a verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  for lira stability, which sent the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower.\par \par \uc2 After his comments, the lira weakened to 1.8111 against the dollar and the yield on two year bonds traded at 6.35% compared with 6.47% early Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 At its monetary policy committee meeting March 26, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut its overnight lending rate by 100 basis points, in a surprise move, while it kept its key policy interest rate and overnight borrowing rates steady.\par \par \uc2 The bank cut its overnight rate to 7.50% from 8.50%; it left its one-week benchmark interest rate at 5.50% and its overnight borrowing rate at 4.50%.\par \par \uc2 Write to Joe Parkinson joe.parkinson@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 April 04, 2013 08:20 ET (12:20 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130404e94400368\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
