\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Turkish c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  to support lira\b0\par\par\uc2 554 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Januar 2012\par 13:25\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds background, quotes)\par \par \uc2 ISTANBUL, Jan 3 (Reuters) - The Turkish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  supported the lira \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday, selling dollars in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for a third trading day in a row to help the lira recover from its weakest ever level struck last week.\par \par \uc2 The bank confirmed that it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , without disclosing the amount.\par \par \uc2 Earlier in the afternoon, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $350 million in \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  selling auction to support the ailing lira.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  started to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly, right after the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  selling auction. The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  size is very low, between $150-200 million. We see the bank is not aggressive at all," wrote Fatih Keresteci, a strategist at \uc2 HSBC\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  uses unsterilized \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales and direct \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support additional monetary tightening. It will push medium term and long term yields up... This will be used to fight against the inflation and current account deficit... This is the right thing to do," he added.\par \par \uc2 The Turkish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  firmed as far as 1.8697 against the dollar during the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from 1.8816 beforehand. However, it eased back at 1.8820 at 1309 GMT.\par \par \uc2 The lira hit 1.9215 on Dec. 28, an all time weakest level against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Against a euro-dollar basket the lira firmed as far as 2.1481 from 2.1648 early in the morning and stood at 2.1655 after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the afternoon.\par \par \uc2 The bank is estimated to sell around $2.75 billion during two previous direct \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders told Reuters.\par \par \uc2 The lira hit 1.9215 on Dec. 28, an all time weakest level against the dollar.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Erdem Basci said last week the bank may sell foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly on "exceptional days", without specifying what would make a day exceptional.\par \par \uc2 Since Friday, analysts estimate that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sold $4.65 billion through direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and auctions, but mostly direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 There has been heavy corporate demand for foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in recent days as firms needed to pay for imports.\par \par \uc2 During a meeting with economists on Tuesday, the bank said unsterilized \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales and \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be used to complement monetary tightening.\par \par \uc2 "The aim here is to prevent inflation expectations to be adversely affected from exchange rate movements detached from (macroeconomic) fundamentals," the bank added.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  can decide not to sterilize \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales by not providing the amount of lira drained from the market through repo auctions, decreasing lira liquidity in the market.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's unorthodox policy mix last year has combined lower interest rates, higher banking reserve ratios and a wider gap between borrowing and lending rates as it looks to rein in the current account deficit and defend the lira.\par \par \uc2 However, the lira was one of the worst performing emerging \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2011, losing nearly 22 percent against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's weakness risks adding to inflationary pressures.\par \par \uc2 Turkey's consumer price index rose 0.58 percent month-on-month in December, exceeding a Reuters poll forecast of a 0.30 percent rise, for a year-on-year rise of 10.45 percent, highest in three years, data showed on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 (Writing by Ece Toksabay and Seltem Iyigun; Editing by Simon Cameron-Moore)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 TURKEY\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CBANK/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120106e813000nf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
