\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Turkish c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 fx \highlight\uc2  market, selling  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  - bankers\b0\par\par\uc2 265 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Dezember 2011\par 12:25\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds quotes, background)\par \par \uc2 ISTANBUL, Dec 30 (Reuters) - The Turkish \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday, selling dollars, bankers told Reuters, prompting a rally in the lira to below 1.86 against the dollar from 1.9 beforehand.\par \par \uc2 The lira subsequently weakened back to 1.8840 against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The lira touched a record low of 1.9215 in late trade on Wednesday due to concerns about monetary policy measures.\par \par \uc2 The volume of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not immediately clear.\par \par \uc2 "The TCMB (\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a very aggressive fashion," said \uc2 HSBC\uc2  strategist Fatih Keresteci. "But as liquidity is rather low, there may not be a high volume behind this movement," he added.\par \par \uc2 Around the time that the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  began, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  issued a statement it will continue to hold \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 -selling auctions on days when it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to hold (\b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 -selling) auctions on days when it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly in the market," the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has this year been pursuing an unorthodox policy mix of lower interest rates, higher banking reserve ratios and a wider gap between borrowing and lending rates as it looks to rein in the current account deficit and defend the lira.\par \par \uc2 This week it said it will sell more foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly to the market and provide lira liquidity at higher interest than usual when necessary.\par \par \uc2 (Writing by Daren Butler)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 TURKEY\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CBANK/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120102e7cu000cm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
