\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ Turkey  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  To Sell A Maximum Of $350M At Daily  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Auction\b0\par\par\uc2 229 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Oktober 2011\par 10:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2011, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 24 Oct 2011 04:14 EDT DJ  Turkey \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  To Sell A Maximum Of $350M At Daily \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  Auction\par \par \uc2 LONDON (Dow Jones)--Turkey's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  put a maximum $350 million up for auction Monday as part of its efforts to stem weakness in the lira.\par \par \uc2 The amount on offer is much less than the record $1.35 billion that was offered at auctions last Tuesday and Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  left its key interest rate at a record low Thursday, but increased the overnight lending rate and issued a hawkish statement in an effort to shore up the embattled lira.\par \par \uc2 The bank began holding daily dollar auctions in August in an effort to support the lira. The weak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  threatens to send inflation out of control by lifting the cost of imported goods.\par \par \uc2 In a further effort to prevent lira weakness, \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market last Tuesday for the first time in more than five years.\par \par \uc2 At 0801 GMT, the dollar was trading at TRY1.8285 against the Turkish lira, compared with TRY1.8305 prior to the announcement.\par \par \uc2 -By Jessica Mead, Dow Jones Newswires, 44 20 7842 9256;\par \par \uc2 jessica.mead@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 October 24, 2011 04:14 ET (08:14 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020111024e7ao001ji\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
